    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The diagram's Requirements Approved? diamond. Yes leads to completion; No leads to a new pass through Create Detailed Requirements and review. A reasoner does not evaluate the condition or create Activities. The exact set of leaf Steps repeated on revision is left unspecified.</rdfs:comment>
