  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.michaeldebellis.com/process_model/IntervalContains_DirectDates">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#Imp"/>
    <rdfs:label>IntervalContains_DirectDates</rdfs:label>
    <swrla:isRuleEnabled rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</swrla:isRuleEnabled>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Allen interval relation: a.start &lt; b.start and b.end &lt; a.end. Compares time:inXSDDateTimeStamp values directly; both intervals must have beginning/end timestamps with start &lt; end. Equal timestamps may belong to distinct instant individuals. No instant-to-instant ordering is materialized. Inverse relations are supplied by the retained OWL-Time inverse-property axioms.</rdfs:comment>
