    <vann:preferredNamespacePrefix>sulo</vann:preferredNamespacePrefix>
    <vann:preferredNamespaceUri rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/sulo/"/>
    <vann:preferredNamespaceUri>http://purl.org/net/p-plan#</vann:preferredNamespaceUri>
    <rdfs:comment>PROV extension for linking Plans and parts of plans to their respective executions. Created by Daniel Garijo and Yolanda Gil</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Historical metadata copied unchanged from the uploaded merged ontology header. This record retains upstream attribution, license statements, version notes and merge history; it is not a declaration of interchangeable licenses for the combined ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Subset of the W3C PROV-O ontology containing only the terms needed by the Basic Reusable Ontology (Big Bro). IRIs of PROV terms are preserved; content not required by Big Bro has been omitted.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The Simplified Upper Level Ontology (SULO) is ontology with a minimal set of classes and relations to guide the development of a personal health knowledge graph.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://dx.doi.org/10.3233/SW-150187"/>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://www.semantic-web-journal.net/content/time-ontology-extended-non-gregorian-calendar-applications"/>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/TR/owl-time"/>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/TR/prov-o/"/>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov"/>
    <owl:backwardCompatibleWith rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/sulo/sulo-0.2.3.ttl"/>
    <owl:priorVersion rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2006/time#2006"/>
    <owl:priorVersion rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/sulo/sulo-0.2.3.ttl"/>
    <owl:versionInfo>0.2.14</owl:versionInfo>
    <owl:versionInfo>1.0.0</owl:versionInfo>
    <owl:versionInfo>1.2</owl:versionInfo>
    <owl:versionInfo xml:lang="en">Recommendation version 2013-04-30, subsetted as PROV-Lite for Big Bro</owl:versionInfo>
    <skos:changeNote>2016-06-15 - initial update of OWL-Time - modified to support arbitrary temporal reference systems. </skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>2016-12-20 - adjust range of time:timeZone to time:TimeZone, moved up from the tzont ontology.  </skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>2016-12-20 - restore time:Year and time:January which were present in the 2006 version of the ontology, but now marked "deprecated". </skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>2017-02 - intervalIn, intervalDisjoint, monthOfYear added; TemporalUnit subclass of TemporalDuration</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>2017-04-06 - hasTime, hasXSDDuration added; Number removed; all duration elements changed to xsd:decimal</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>Imported SULO upper model: https://w3id.org/sulo/
December 17, 2025
Michael DeBellis</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote xml:lang="en">2025-11-29 (M. DeBellis): Created PROV-Lite as a cleaned subset of the W3C PROV-O Turtle serialization for use with the Basic Reusable Ontology (Big Bro).
– Removed duplicate owl:Ontology declarations.
– Moved orphaned ontology metadata triples (label, seeAlso, versionIRI, versionInfo, specializationOf, wasRevisionOf) under this ontology IRI.
– Removed stray non-comment prose that appeared after the :wasStartedBy axiom and caused Turtle parse errors.
– Trimmed PROV terms and axioms not required by Big Bro, without changing the IRIs or logical meaning of the retained PROV terms.</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote xml:lang="en">Imported P-Plan Ontology: https://www.opmw.org/model/p-plan/
Source file: https://www.opmw.org/p-plan.owl
Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 2.0 Generic License at: http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/2.0/
MD 10/8/2026</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote xml:lang="en">Imported W3C Time with SWRL Rules for Allen Interval Algebra from: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mdebellis/Time-Ontology-With-SWRL-Rules/refs/heads/main/W3C%20Time%20With%20SWRL%20Rules%20V2.ttl  

Merged Time into Bro_Pro and renamed to process_model

MD 10-22-2026</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote xml:lang="en">Merged owl:imports &lt;http://purl.org/net/p-plan#&gt; MD 10/8/2026</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:editorialNote xml:lang="en">Basic_Bro includes the legacy Dublin Core (dc:) namespace only because it is automatically imported by DCTERMS for backward compatibility. BRO users should always use dcterms:* properties and never use dc:* properties.</skos:editorialNote>
    <skos:historyNote>2023-09-12  Added SWRL rules and some test cases to implement the logic of the various operators. 

Michael DeBellis mdebellissf@gmail.com</skos:historyNote>
    <skos:historyNote xml:lang="en">Update of OWL-Time ontology, extended to support general temporal reference systems. 

Ontology engineering by Simon J D Cox</skos:historyNote>
    <skos:note xml:lang="en">Basic_Bro reuses annotation and datatype properties from the SKOS and DCTERMS vocabularies. All classes and object properties from imported vocabularies have been removed to provide a clean metadata-only reusable layer.</skos:note>
