    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2006/time#DurationDescription"/>
    <owl:deprecated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</owl:deprecated>
    <skos:definition>Year duration</skos:definition>
    <skos:historyNote>Year was proposed in the 2006 version of OWL-Time as an example of how DurationDescription could be specialized to allow for a duration to be restricted to a number of years. 

It is deprecated in this edition of OWL-Time. </skos:historyNote>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ar">سنة</skos:prefLabel>
