    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Communication step</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A planned communication task, which may include sending a request and awaiting a reply. Input/output dependencies can therefore be cyclic at this abstraction level without defining a cyclic control-flow sequence.</rdfs:comment>
